        WHERE h2.invoice_id = ai.invoice_id)',
      p_title                  => 'MGD-470',
      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Invoices which have been approved still have workflow status of INITIATED.<br/><strong>Impact Area(s): </strong>Invoice Approval, Payment Selection',
      p_solution               => '<strong>Solution GDF: </strong>24579872</br><strong>Note: </strong>[2202234/KB764251]</br><strong>Script Name: </strong>ap_x_approval_status_sel.sql</br></br>Apply the GDF patch following the instructions provided in [2202234/KB764251].',
