      p_solution               => '<strong>Bug Number: </strong>12660674</br><strong>Script Name: </strong>priccor_reltd_id_null_sel.sql</br></br>Apply the root cause fix from bug {12660674} if you have not done so, and log a Service Request to obtain the data fix.',
